{"overview":"پس از دیدن خودکشی مادرش پس از طلاق، شو چی با سرنوشت تراژیک خود مقابله می‌کند و از یک فارغ‌التحصیل عادی به مشاور برتر و هوشمند تبدیل می‌شود. درگیر طرح انتقام مخفی شریک باتجربه‌یی، یِی شِنژی، که او را راهنمایی می‌کند و در عین حال رابطه‌ی متقابل‌شان را پیش می‌برد، این دو در مواجهه با نقطه‌ی عطفی قرار می‌گیرند که تحولات حرفه‌ای با پیوند در حال شکل‌گیری‌شان تداخل می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"After witnessing her mother's suicide following a divorce, Xu Chi defies her tragic fate by rising from an ordinary graduate to a sharp-witted top consultant. Drawn into the covert revenge scheme of seasoned partner Ye Xinzhi, who mentors her while navigating their growing mutual attraction, the duo confronts a crossroads when professional upheavals collide with their evolving bond.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":20,"y":2026,"poster":""}],"episodes":20,"crew":["Chen Shi Yi","陈铭章"],"crew_en":["Chen Shi Yi","Chen Ming Zhang"],"countries":["CN"],"cast":[{"name":"赵今麦","role":"Xu Chi","photo":"/hndhOhSK0GAMi1qQaacacl3aHzO.jpg","en":"Zhao Jinmai"},{"name":"魏大勋","role":"Ye Xinzhi","photo":"/8zDh8Tp6xbVSpxr307alnGqUiJP.jpg","en":"Wei Daxun"},{"name":"周奇","role":"Zhao Heng","photo":"/p8mUtx6C5o6jVYQ86eSOMvN3ZTz.jpg","en":"Zhou Qi"},{"name":"白冰","role":"Lin Long","photo":"/nfrH7OSmsk6tYrpDQMJrKmMAZ5K.jpg","en":"Michelle Bai"},{"name":"胡意旋","role":"Bu Tianna","photo":"/vOa4szQkowRT34eNPvjwwJKqBAN.jpg","en":"Hu Yixuan"},{"name":"田轩宁","role":"Deng Anran","photo":"/vaUH8rLS3PeRLEqeDykskrcs9GN.jpg","en":"Tian Xuanning"},{"name":"高茂桐","role":"Ou Lizheng","photo":"/hbKO08mqWrH1OHoXKehnRxE4MTC.jpg","en":"Gao Maotong"},{"name":"王媛可","role":"Shasha","photo":"/mmBKZFjoyz9PvPScmk6IFIz1XKz.jpg","en":"Wang Yuanke"},{"name":"Wang Xi","role":"Xin Di","photo":"/zKIhHre4B64eWegn6bPoBMd4mCH.jpg","en":"Xi Wang"},{"name":"林小宅","role":"Su Su","photo":"/uO7gpoyUOuMGchUcVf83HlRLlRr.jpg","en":"Hana Lin"},{"name":"Wu Lipeng","role":